+      "offset": 18795,
+      "length": 212,
+      "value": "\"Cannot convert a WeakMap or WeakSet to a native value, because JavaScript doesn't allow reading their entries. Pass a Map or Set instead, or declare the native type as JavaScriptValue to receive it unconverted.\""
